From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Sun, 08 Nov 2015 20:10:49 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan] `increment_log_prob` only allowed in the `model` section (#889)
Message-ID: <Q2mbNeLGHH4.QNF9QbhoDgAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/Q2mbNeLGHH4/m/QNF9QbhoDgAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
